To exercise your California privacy rights, you may:

• Email us at {{PRIVACY_EMAIL}}
• Call us at {{PRIVACY_PHONE}}
• Submit a request through our website at {{PRIVACY_FORM_URL}}

We will verify your identity before processing requests and respond within 45 days (extendable to 90 days for complex requests). You may designate an authorized agent to make requests on your behalf.

For opt-out requests, you can also use the "Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information" link on our website.

For questions about this privacy policy or our privacy practices, contact us at:

{{COMPANY_NAME}}
{{COMPANY_ADDRESS}}
Email: {{PRIVACY_EMAIL}}
Phone: {{PRIVACY_PHONE}}

We may update this policy periodically. Material changes will be posted on our website with an updated effective date. We encourage you to review this policy regularly to stay informed about our privacy practices.
